{"steam_appid":3278310,"steam_name":"LANESPLIT","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3278310/1030362374/be244b16040af8cbfb788887fa11309011f86e2c/1782740780/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782741669","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257367725/1693c47adc1a952fe64f1bffd114724016e138e4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782741669","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/71563e5f14c64a10d0adef142c1b9f513836dafc/ss_71563e5f14c64a10d0adef142c1b9f513836dafc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782741920","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/ss_cf39ac4291c7f1954bb8a853d7ff878ca8694ea1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782741920","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/8feaee6c769b05f4952984b1bd631a398bce75af/ss_8feaee6c769b05f4952984b1bd631a398bce75af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782741920","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/ss_fb7d12dc70f7ce2f42bc91dd82262ab8e959130d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782741920","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/ss_8085018a3d67d546dd790e0a099f0d6ef5f9108d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782741920"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer Mode</u></strong><u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride solo or with friends. The faster you ride, the higher your score multiplier, with the biggest rewards coming from high speeds and close, skillful lane splitting. Crashes or driving too slowly will reset your current points to zero with your highest points being saved to the global leaderboards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/e9f773858d8c78392214ec060026e02c.poster.avif?t=1782741920\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/e9f773858d8c78392214ec060026e02c.webm?t=1782741920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/e9f773858d8c78392214ec060026e02c.mp4?t=1782741920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiple Weather and Traffic Settings</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer dry roads with ease by selecting bikes with high top speed and agile handling, and maximize traction and stopping power during wet-weather rides.<br>Test riding reflexes during Rush Hour mode, and become one with the road in Zen mode, where you have the road all to yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/c56ddd518074e5233471a9595553799c.poster.avif?t=1782741920\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/c56ddd518074e5233471a9595553799c.webm?t=1782741920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/c56ddd518074e5233471a9595553799c.mp4?t=1782741920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Become King of the Road</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As breakneck speeds turn the world into a blur, enter a flow state as LANESPLIT’s drum &amp; bass soundtrack increases in volume as you accelerate (and comes to a crashing halt when colliding with traffic).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/f4de20c55c21ab3ebe0a69a9bd4212b1.poster.avif?t=1782741920\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/f4de20c55c21ab3ebe0a69a9bd4212b1.webm?t=1782741920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/f4de20c55c21ab3ebe0a69a9bd4212b1.mp4?t=1782741920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen R5 1600 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 11 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR Support</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K or AMD Ryzen R5 3600 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 11 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR Support</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Racing","Simulation","Sports"],"developers":["FunkyMouse"],"publishers":["FunkyMouse"],"release_date":"28 Jan, 2026"}